Early on I like to put unidentified wands in a chest to keep
from getting attempted.  I do try engrave ID first so the list
of types is not that long.

For a while I'll avoid carrying cancellation.  Into a stash.

If I find a bag other than holding or tricks I often take up
carrying it for wands.  Eventually an oilskin may get swapped
for a regular sack.

But my main strategy -

Keep a stash and have spare stuff in it.  Blow up the bag,
go pull spares from the chest.  The spares won't be as nice
as the primary items but they are a starting point.



